","text":"インデックス作るとかですかねー。","ts":"1634220961.243200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4QkB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"075c18b8-e3f6-4e47-9896-56eacdda04ef","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"名前生成は問題なくて、必要なファイルを取得する側の問題っぽいですね","ts":"1634220943.242800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uWQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1623225-bdb4-459f-8465-453197c730f7","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"```import ulid\nulid.new()```","ts":"1634220889.241900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YCBn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9a5b3b8-b0fe-4eb7-a85e-f397aa3b6b47","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u0026gt; 被りなしのランダム文字列で埋める\n`uuidgen`","ts":"1634220689.241300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2jg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"177458fd-3edc-4b14-98a5-4f35a4858d00","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"pandasかsqliteか使ったら絞り込み速くなるかなあと","ts":"1634219405.238900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X6G1j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"560b6b00-97bb-4ec7-b3a6-9633033c8d05","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"欲しいファイルのリストを作るときに毎回pathlib.iterdirして名前を正規表現で判定して、、、ってやってたら数が増えて遅さを感じるようになって来ました","ts":"1634219315.238100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V66w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66268cbd-8ed4-4a61-b7cf-9982dc8d3fea","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"`xxx_a=1_b=10` みたいな感じにして、xxxの部分が被りなしのランダム文字列で埋める、みたいな感じです","ts":"1634219209.235800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Vph+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19afa0ae-b02f-4779-8c3a-bc47b8269739","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"ファイル名の一意性とpandasの関係がよくわかりません……。","ts":"1634219023.233000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y4l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"937d56bc-c839-43fc-ac9e-8de91f67200c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"たくさんあるファイルの処理をファイル名が一意になるようにしてやってきたけど、当初思ってたよりだいぶ数が出て来てしんどみがでてきた\npandasとか使ってないけど、覚えたほうがいいんだろうな","ts":"1634218872.232500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DQk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d11ff2b-f648-4ba3-8e30-f68e2cea16f8","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"今ならdenops?","ts":"1634195046.230000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"otxu","count":2,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qZMl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9bd97b6d-f4a7-4805-a8a8-22e03c97a8cd","type":"message","user":"UGMEJADF1","text":"上記のプラグインの難点がipynbとpythonファイル間の変換の処理を非同期で動く外部のCUIコマンドに依存してる点にあって、その部分をvital.vimで書き換えていたのですが途中で力付きている。","ts":"1634194187.229000","edited":{"user":"UGMEJADF1","ts":"1634194645.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e9X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e54f368-776c-458a-96b5-8bc84d136c6c","type":"message","user":"UGMEJADF1","text":"そうですね。私も ipynbファイルじゃなくて.pyにコード書いて quickrun.vimで実行する形で済ませてます。","ts":"1634193826.224900","edited":{"user":"UGMEJADF1","ts":"1634194258.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iP6T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f759f02-dc72-4187-9143-c07ba8d21999","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私はJupyterみたいなインタラクティブなコード実行はもう Vim のターミナルの ipython にコード送る形で済ませちゃってますね…","ts":"1634193610.222700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=ge"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4af1dc85-c782-4b68-b5a8-c8603023461e","type":"message","user":"UGMEJADF1","text":"ただ実装にかなり難点があるので、本格的に使うならフォークして欲しい。\n具体的にはブラウザでipynbを開きながら vim で ipynbを編集して ` :wq`  で保存して抜けようとしたときに、ipynbファイルがブラウザ側にマウントされているのが原因で、更新内容をファイルに反映するのに失敗したまま vim が終了する。(迂闊にやってしまったときは、キャッシュから編集内容拾えるけど実装の欠陥でしかない)","ts":"1634192608.219300","edited":{"user":"UGMEJADF1","ts":"1634193215.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"scream","count":1,"users":["U06ECBRTJ"]},{"name":"contribute-chance","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mrr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"891da8d4-9e8e-42bd-9dd2-ba64726a498b","type":"message","user":"UGMEJADF1","text":"自作ですが、vim上でvscodeやpycharmに近い感覚でipynbを編集するできる(実際、vscodeのipynbのパース処理を真似している)プラグイン\n\u003chttps://github.com/anosillus/vim-ipynb\u003e","ts":"1634192307.215500","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"anosillus/vim-ipynb","id":1,"title":"anosillus/vim-ipynb","text":"Edit your Jupyter notebooks in Vim/Neovim","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"7","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Vim script","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ultrafastparrot","count":3,"users":["U06ECBRTJ","U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zzr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a503bf5d-26d0-4083-bf53-8fe299ebee83","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"JetBrain 様が\n\u003chttps://github.com/Ruin0x11/intellij-lsp-server\u003e\nこういうのをやってもらえると嬉しいんだけど、彼らがやるメリットないし難しいでしょうねー。","ts":"1634180988.209900","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"Ruin0x11/intellij-lsp-server","id":1,"title":"Ruin0x11/intellij-lsp-server","text":"Exposes IntelliJ IDEA features through the Language Server Protocol.","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"314","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Kotlin","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","coun